ntined (CVE-2026-4417)", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "semantic", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 8267, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_014Asq3D2KMhYy71EEcrHpT7", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 13187, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01CVhu5U6xUTe8b9Ltm1sw5o", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.2.9"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 17187, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01CVhu5U6xUTe8b9Ltm1sw5o", "tool": "rollback", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 17187, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01CVhu5U6xUTe8b9Ltm1sw5o", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 18920, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01CY2mPzuEuqF2LjsNtjjSqg", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 19220, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01CY2mPzuEuqF2LjsNtjjSqg", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 19220, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01CY2mPzuEuqF2LjsNtjjSqg", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19220, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01MBqKuwUKDVF7q56Vz2QMCJ", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 19520, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01MBqKuwUKDVF7q56Vz2QMCJ", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 19520, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01MBqKuwUKDVF7q56Vz2QMCJ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 24022, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01L2X6fQLcU2ky1GG36DBpby", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.2.9", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After the v2.3.1 deploy, checkout-api failed health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of about 18%. The most recent healthy production release, v2.3.0, could not be used because it is quarantined for CVE-2026-4417, so the rollback to it was rejected. checkout-api was rolled back in all regions to v2.2.9, the next most recent release that was healthy in production. After the rollback, the service reports healthy with an error rate of about 0.2%. Follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure (v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging), and confirm whether v2.2.9 is affected by CVE-2026-4417.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.2.9"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 24622, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01L2X6fQLcU2ky1GG36DBpby", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.2.9", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 24622, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01L2X6fQLcU2ky1GG36DBpby", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 29643, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back and healthy again in all regions, but it's on **v2.2.9**, not v2.3.0. v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production, but the system rejected the rollback because that version is quarantined for CVE-2026-4417.\n\n- **Before:** v2.3.1 was live in us-east, us-west and eu-west. It was failing health checks with about an 18% error rate.\n- **Rollback:** v2.2.9 is the next most recent release that was healthy in production, so I rolled back to it in all three regions. It didn't need change-manager approval because it has been healthy in production before.\n- **After:** the service reports healthy, and the error rate is down to about 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api, which paged on-call. It explains the rollback, why I skipped v2.3.0, and the follow-ups below.\n\nFollow-ups:\n- v2.3.1 was already unhealthy in staging as v2.3.1-rc, so it's worth finding out why it still went to production.\n- Someone should check whether v2.2.9 is also affected by CVE-2026-4417. The system didn't block it, but I haven't confirmed it's unaffected.\n\nIf you'd rather not run v2.2.9 for long, we'll need a patched release.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01LFR94anxoyaN3JYmQ4EiUb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01RaDDwbD6G52SK1sRHK9ADQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy production release is v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_014Asq3D2KMhYy71EEcrHpT7", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01CVhu5U6xUTe8b9Ltm1sw5o", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.2.9"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01CY2mPzuEuqF2LjsNtjjSqg", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01MBqKuwUKDVF7q56Vz2QMCJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01L2X6fQLcU2ky1GG36DBpby", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.2.9", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After the v2.3.1 deploy, checkout-api failed health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of about 18%. The most recent healthy production release, v2.3.0, could not be used because it is quarantined for CVE-2026-4417, so the rollback to it was rejected. checkout-api was rolled back in all regions to v2.2.9, the next most recent release that was healthy in production. After the rollback, the service reports healthy with an error rate of about 0.2%. Follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure (v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging), and confirm whether v2.2.9 is affected by CVE-2026-4417.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.2.9"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "checkout-api is rolled back and healthy again in all regions, but it's on **v2.2.9**, not v2.3.0. v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production, but the system rejected the rollback because that version is quarantined for CVE-2026-4417.\n\n- **Before:** v2.3.1 was live in us-east, us-west and eu-west. It was failing health checks with about an 18% error rate.\n- **Rollback:** v2.2.9 is the next most recent release that was healthy in production, so I rolled back to it in all three regions. It didn't need change-manager approval because it has been healthy in production before.\n- **After:** the service reports healthy, and the error rate is down to about 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api, which paged on-call. It explains the rollback, why I skipped v2.3.0, and the follow-ups below.\n\nFollow-ups:\n- v2.3.1 was already unhealthy in staging as v2.3.1-rc, so it's worth finding out why it still went to production.\n- Someone should check whether v2.2.9 is also affected by CVE-2026-4417. The system didn't block it, but I haven't confirmed it's unaffected.\n\nIf you'd rather not run v2.2.9 for long, we'll need a patched release.", "type": "text"}]}]}